@host = http://localhost:5227
@josh = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@steve = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Get preferences for a seeded customer (200)
GET {{host}}/api/customers/{{josh}}/notification-preferences

### Update preferences (200, notification logged by the API)
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/{{steve}}/notification-preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{ "emailEnabled": true, "smsEnabled": true }

### Unknown customer (404)
GET {{host}}/api/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/notification-preferences

### Invalid GUID (400)
GET {{host}}/api/customers/not-a-guid/notification-preferences

### Missing property (400)
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/{{josh}}/notification-preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{ "emailEnabled": true }